{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c0d4f4e1-3e6a-4e06-a7fb-9b7c0f2c9c01",
    "name": "DaaS Orchestrator - Fases TNLCM/ELCM",
    "description": "🚀 FLUJO COMPLETO DaaS (Data as a Service) con dos fases:\n\n🔐 Paso previo opcional (TNLCM):\n0. POST /tnlcm/token/refresh → obtiene access_token con TNLCM_USER/TNLCM_PASSWORD\n\n📍 FASE 1 - TNLCM (Trial Network Lifecycle Management):\n1. POST /executions/tnlcm → Despliega infraestructura de red\n2. GET /executions/{id} → Espera a que status=completed\n3. [MANUAL] Activa VPN WireGuard en tu máquina\n\n📍 FASE 2 - ELCM (Experiment Lifecycle Management):\n4. POST /executions/{id}/elcm → Ejecuta experimentos\n5. GET /executions/{id} → Consulta progreso\n6. [AUTO] Limpieza: destroy + purge TNLCM\n\n✅ El execution_id se guarda automáticamente en {{executionId}}\n⚠️  Asegúrate de activar VPN manualmente ANTES del paso 4",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
