          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-api-key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"infrastructure\": {\n    \"name\": \"tn-demo-manual\",\n    \"descriptor_path\": \"tn_descriptor_elcm.yaml\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"library_reference_type\": \"branch\",\n      \"library_reference_value\": \"develop\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"experiment\": {\n    \"name\": \"exp-demo\",\n    \"testcase_paths\": [\n      \"TestCase_ping.yml\"\n    ],\n    \"ues_paths\": []\n  },\n  \"dataset\": {\n    \"output\": \"logs\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/executions/tnlcm",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "executions",
                "tnlcm"
              ]
            },
            "description": "🚀 FASE 1: Despliega Trial Network (TN)\n\n📋 Pasos después de ejecutar:\n1. Copia execution_id de la respuesta\n2. Espera con GET /executions/{id} a que status=completed\n3. ⚠️ IMPORTANTE: Activa VPN WireGuard manualmente\n4. Recién entonces ejecuta POST /executions/{id}/elcm\n\n✅ Características:\n• execution_id = infrastructure.name (determinista)\n• Recuperación automática si /activate falla\n• Reporte en ./artifacts/{execution_id}/tnlcm_report_raw.md\n• Resumen en ./artifacts/{execution_id}/template_tnlcm_report_summary.json\n• Timeout: 1 hora máximo\n\n⚡ Cambios automáticos en variables:\nExecutionId = respuesta.execution_id"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /executions/{execution_id}/elcm",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-api-key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/executions/{{executionId}}/elcm",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "executions",
                "{{executionId}}",
                "elcm"
              ]
            },
            "description": "🔥 FASE 2: Ejecuta experimentos (ELCM)\n\n⚠️ REQUISITOS (crítico):\n✅ TNLCM debe estar completado (status=completed)\n✅ VPN WireGuard activada MANUALMENTE\n✅ Connectivity a Trial Network verificada\n\n📋 Qué hace automáticamente:\n1. Sube test cases a ELCM\n2. Lanza experimento con descriptor Exp_Desc.json\n3. Polling cada 10s hasta \"Finished\" (timeout 1h)\n4. Recoge logs de ejecución\n5. Manejo inteligente: Si logs no listos → Consulta TNLCM status\n6. Al finalizar: AUTO destroy + purge de TN (cleanup)\n\n📊 Resultado:\n• Logs guardados en ./artifacts/{id}/\n• Estados ELCM: Running → Finished → Completed\n• Si error: Status=failed, message con detalles\n\n❌ Error 400 Bad Request:\nSignifica execution_id no existe en memoria\n→ Crea nueva ejecución con POST /executions/tnlcm"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /executions/{execution_id}",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-api-key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/executions/{{executionId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "executions",
                "{{executionId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "📊 Consulta estado de ejecución (TNLCM o ELCM)\n\n🔄 Estados posibles:\n• pending: Recibida pero no iniciada\n• validating: Validando descriptor\n• deploying: Creando infraestructura\n• completed: TNLCM listo (espera VPN manual)\n• running_experiment: ELCM en progreso\n• collecting: Recopilando logs\n• failed: Error en alguna fase\n\n💡 Úsalo para monitorear:\n1. Después de POST /executions/tnlcm → Espera status=completed\n2. Después de POST /executions/{id}/elcm → Espera status=completed"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /executions/{execution_id}/detail",
          "request": {
